They have given false Report vide Letter No.01 dated 17.01.2023 being sufficiently bribed to show favour to get the On-Shop License to run the Bar-cum-Restaurant named as "Rout and Rout Restaurant".
// 2 //
4. Facts of the case is that one Madhusudan Rout falsely stated to be the owner of Rout and Rout Restaurant located at Village-Guruala under Badakaudi Gram Panchayat of Rasulpur Block, has applied to the Collector, Jajpur for an On-Shop License to convert the aforesaid Restaurant to a Sanamali Rath vs State Of Odisha & Others ....
